                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "* \tHayward orchard\n* \tIrrigated\n* \tOn light Pumice soils\n* \tNitrogen input reduced from 400 to 25 kg/ha\n* \tRecommended for use\n* \tSteve to update (to July 2024)\n*\tLocated in Pukehina\n*\tLocated near Paengaroa (weather)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
                  "Name": "ReadMe",
