            {
              "$type": "Models.Core.Simulation, Models",
              "Name": "Katikati",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "*\tLocated in Katikati\n* \tStudy ran from 2021 to 2025- based oon  Green S, Arnold N, Snelgar P, Cummins M, Lawrence-Smith E, Jones Y. February 2026. SN22140 Vine water needs and set points for smart\nirrigation of ‘Zesy002’ (Gold3) kiwifruit; Final project report. A Bioeconomy Science Institute report prepared for: Zespri Group Limited. Milestone\nNo. 92502. Contract No. 25/39697. Job code: P/442092/01. SPTS No. 28261\n*\tSheltered orchard with no netting(details in ref.)\n*\tIrrigated (simulating the **well-watered only**)\n\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\nMeasurements were\n*\tSap-flow\n*\tFruit growth\n*\tSoil moisture (150–160; 30/20 cm interval); TDR\n*\tLight interception. \n",
                  "Name": "ReadMe",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Clock, Models",
                  "Start": "2022-07-01T00:00:00",
                  "End": "2025-12-01T00:00:00",
                  "Name": "Clock",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Summary, Models",
                  "Verbosity": 100,
                  "Name": "SummaryFile",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Climate.Weather, Models",
                  "ConstantsFile": null,
                  "FileName": "Weather_SG/KatikatiMeteoBlue.met",
